{"metadata":{"name":"Sunan an Nasai","name_native":"সুনান আন-নাসায়ী","section":{"7":"The Book of the Adhan (The Call to Prayer)"},"section_detail":{"7":{"hadithnumber_first":626,"hadithnumber_last":687,"arabicnumber_first":626,"arabicnumber_last":687,"name_native":"সালাত (নামাজ) অধ্যায়"}}},"hadiths":[{"hadithnumber":652,"arabicnumber":652,"text":"। সুওয়ায়দ (রহঃ) ... আবূ মাহযূরা (রাঃ) থেকে বর্ণিত। তিনি বলেন যে, আযানের শেষ বাক্য ছিল, لاَ إِلَهَ إِلاَّ اللَّهُ","grades":[{"name":"Abu Ghuddah","grade":"Sahih Isnaad"},{"name":"Al-Albani","grade":"Sahih Isnaad"},{"name":"Zubair Ali Zai","grade":"Isnaad Sahih"}],"reference":{"book":7,"hadith":27}}]}